[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19216.628, "timestamp": "05:20:16", "text": "等等，直播有延迟吗？在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19223.8, "timestamp": "05:20:23", "text": "溪流。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19230.51, "timestamp": "05:20:30", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19233.03, "timestamp": "05:20:33", "text": "等等，你们都没见过“我的天哪”吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19235.03, "timestamp": "05:20:35", "text": "她往那边走了。那条路。不，那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19252.23, "timestamp": "05:20:52", "text": "扇子。好吧，她的确达到了1000。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19255.03, "timestamp": "05:20:55", "text": "粉丝。是的。不，是1万粉丝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19258.15, "timestamp": "05:20:58", "text": "我们走吧。她明白了，她可能进去了。"}]